1378
01:28:58,672 --> 01:29:01,216
This is a mandatory evacuation.
ນີ້ແມ່ນການຍົກຍ້າຍທີ່ບັງຄັບໃຊ້.

1379
01:29:08,348 --> 01:29:10,309
Yeah, I'm sure
she's scared, but find her.
